cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "ag-cube-cm: spatial process-based crop model orchestration on climate and soil datacubes"
version: 0.3.7
date-released: 2026-11-20
abstract: >-
  ag-cube-cm is a Python package for running process-based crop models
  (DSSAT, CAF2021, SIMPLE, Banana-N) pixel by pixel over climate and soil
  datacubes, producing gridded yield maps. It is the crop-modelling layer of a
  two-package workflow with aggeodata and powers the CGIAR Climate Data Hub
  spatial-crop-modeler AI agent skill, developed in collaboration with AgWise
  (CGIAR Sustainable Farming Program).
